  "description": "Moon Ah-Rim has a secret. One accidental touch, and he can hear exactly what you're thinking. So when he accidentally brushes against his longtime crush, Tae-Hun, he expects butterflies…not full-blown NSFW fantasies! Sweet, gentle Tae-Hun isn’t supposed to have those kinds of thoughts, and especially not about him! Ah-Rim is horrified...and maybe just a little intrigued. Because no matter how much he tells himself not to feel anything...his body’s saying otherwise. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)\n\n*Note: Includes seven extra chapters.*",
